    },
    {
      "rank": 2,
      "name": { "en": "Crown on Wings of Bloom", "zh-CN": "以扑翼繁花加冕" },
      "description": {
        "en": "After summoning the memosprite Netherwing, Castorice gains 2 stack(s) of \"Ardent Will.\" \"Ardent Will\" can stack up to 2 time(s) and can be used to offset the HP cost of Netherwing's Memosprite Skill, \"Breath Scorches the Shadow\" and advance Castorice's action by 100%. When using the next Enhanced Skill, Castorice gains \"Newbud\" by an amount equal to 30% of max \"Newbud.\"",
        "zh-CN": "召唤忆灵死龙后，遐蝶获得2层【炽意】，【炽意】最多持有2层，可用来抵扣死龙忆灵技【燎尽黯泽的焰息】的生命值消耗，并使遐蝶行动提前100%，下一次施放强化战技遐蝶获得等同于【新蕊】上限30%点数的【新蕊】。"
