      "description": {
        "en": "When Castorice's current HP is higher than or equal to #1[i]% of her Max HP, her SPD increases by #2[i]%. When Netherwing uses \"Breath Scorches the Shadow\" and deals fatal damage to all enemies on the field or brings them to a point where their HP cannot be reduced further, Netherwing's SPD increases by #3[i]%, lasting for 1 turn.",
        "zh-CN": "遐蝶当前生命值大于等于自身生命上限的#1[i]%时，遐蝶速度提高#2[i]%。死龙施放【燎尽黯泽的焰息】对场上所有敌方造成致命伤害或敌方无法被继续削减生命值时，死龙速度提高#3[i]%，持续1回合。"
